  "body": "The spec says:\n\n> Copy the following from node to copy, depending on the type of node: \n> ...\n> (If Element) Its namespace, namespace prefix, local name, and its attribute list.\n\nCopying the attribute list is underspecified. It seems like it could mean any of the following:\n1. Set _copy_@[[attributeList]] to _node_@[[attributeList]], i.e., maintain a pointer, so that manipulating either element will affect the other.\n2. Loop through _node_@[[attributeList]] and append each attribute to _copy_@[[attributeList]]. In this case, adding or removing attributes from _copy_ will not affect _node_, but updating existing ones will.\n3. Loop through _node_@[[attributeList]] and create new `Attr` objects to append to _copy_@[[attributeList]].\n",
